{"id": "68246", "title": "此罪情深", "author": "拾月初六", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68246.htm", "intro": "【小虐怡情】【HE】\r\n\r\n【JQ篇】周清迈一只手抵在他胸前，抬起腿作势要踢“纪云端，你简直上半身是人，下半身是兽，而且是个禽兽+Yin兽。”\r\n\r\n男人挑了挑眉，握紧了她的腰肢，堪堪躲过这狠狠的一脚“妞，你要是把我下半身性/福毁了，那我就只好拿你下半生幸福来抵了。”\r\n\r\n【文艺篇】她是他的一颗智齿，隐忍疼痛，却终不能自拔！——曹信临\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 虐恋情深 婚恋 生子", "base": "files/article/html/68/68246", "chapters": [{"title": "chapter1.爱与初见", "file": "10518858.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter2.初恋初吻", "file": "10518859.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter3.招ji丑闻", "file": "10518860.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter4.内裤奇遇", "file": "10518861.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter5.分道扬镳", "file": "10518862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter6.躁动青春", "file": "10518863.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter7.骚扰电话", "file": "10518864.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter8.你追我跑", "file": "10518865.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter9.不知不罪", "file": "10518866.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter10.毛毛归来", "file": "10518867.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter11.冰火重遇", "file": "10518868.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter12.相亲会战", "file": "10518869.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter13.莫失莫忘", "file": "10518870.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter14.魔女养成", "file": "10518871.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter15.爱是迷失", "file": "10518872.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-23", "file": "10518873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-30", "file": "10518874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-37", "file": "10518875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-42完结", "file": "10518876.html", "available": false}]}